Trained finder

Weights learned from SpineWeb Dataset 16
  The weights in engine/trained-finder/weights/ were learned from the
  labelled front spine films of SpineWeb Dataset 16, as released for
  the AASCE 2019 challenge. The films are not in this repository. The
  dataset asks that any publication resulting from any use of it cite:
  Wu H, Bailey C, Rasoulinejad P, Li S. Automatic landmark estimation
  for adolescent idiopathic scoliosis assessment using BoostNet.
  Medical Image Computing and Computer Assisted Intervention (MICCAI
  2017), pages 127 to 135.
  (https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-66182-7_15)
  What the weights are: engine/trained-finder/weights/README.md
